# ============================================================================
# ideal.summary — hand-constructed ground-truth summary of this changeset
# (DuckDuckGo Android, AndroidX migration, 143 changed .kt files).
#
# Purpose: the target to refine `summarize` against, and a probe of what the
# pattern language can/cannot express. Compare with baseline.summary
# (57 rules + 51 residuals, main @ 38c4951).
#
# Conventions:
#   - support = number of site files (computed textually from the corpus;
#     not machine-checked through the safety gate).
#   - Rules are grouped: I* imports, A* API changes, then the per-class
#     rename table, then residuals.
#   - Sections marked GAP describe things the current language/proposer
#     cannot express or would not propose; details at each site.
# ============================================================================

# ---- Import renames: package-uniform families (class name abstracted) -----
# These three packages map 1:1 onto their androidx successors, so one rule
# with a class-name metavar covers the whole family. EXPRESSIBLE today
# (bare metavar names required for Kotlin). The baseline instead emits one
# rule per class plus the `- android + androidx` leaf rule.

